<title>USA: Regis Corp Q4 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Regis Corp Q4 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS, Minn. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Mos ended 6/30    12 Mos ended 6/30</p>
<p>		1996     1995	1996     1995</p>
<p>   Service sales	   $ 97,708  $ 78,972 $355,880 $306,298</p>
<p>   Product sales	     36,233    28,528  138,813  111,312</p>
<p> Company-Owned Operations 133,941   107,500  494,693  417,610</p>
